    <TD STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
  <TD STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Under
  the terms of the Subscription Documents and the Operating Agreement, Members may, from time to time, at the discretion of the Manager,
  be required to provide representations, documentation, instruments or information to facilitate a Closing, satisfy Closing Conditions,
  satisfy applicable anti-money laundering requirements and for certain other purposes.</FONT></TD></TR>

<TR STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
