are invited to contact the Manager using the Manager&rsquo;s e-mail information provided herein to review any written materials or documents
relating to the Offering or the Fund, including any financial information available concerning the Fund or the Manager. The Manager will
answer all inquiries from prospective investors relative to the Offering and will provide additional information (to the extent that
the Manager possesses such information or can acquire it without unreasonable effort or expense) necessary to verify the accuracy of
any representations or information set forth in this Memorandum.</FONT></P>

