<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0in; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">NEITHER
THE FUND NOR ANY OF ITS AFFILIATES IS OR WILL BE REGISTERED AS A &ldquo;FINANCIAL INSTRUMENTS FIRM&rdquo; PURSUANT TO THE FINANCIAL INSTRUMENTS
