invest assets in Portfolio Companies that align with Fund&rsquo;s Investment Objectives. The Investment Adviser will recommend whether
and how much to invest in any Portfolio Company based on such factors as the Investment Adviser may consider appropriate including the
management team of the Portfolio Company, other investors in the Portfolio Company, the terms of the proposed investment, any matters
relating to the Company&rsquo;s technology, financial resources, strategy, pricing, market, or competition.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

