</B>Each of the Members shall, and shall direct its Affiliates and the directors, officers, partners, members, employees, attorneys,
accountants, consultants, trustees, advisors and other agents of the foregoing (the &ldquo;<B><I>Representatives</I></B>&rdquo;) who
