Confidential Information or that providing access to such information: (i) may result in the general public gaining access to such information
or that such disclosure would not be in the best interests of the Fund; (ii) could damage the Fund or its business; or (iii) may result
in a violation of applicable law or would violate an agreement between the Fund, the Manager, the Investment Adviser, or any of their
Affiliates with a third party (including, without limitation, any Member).</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

